so featured the Momcozy Wellness 1 (W1) Warm-Massage Wearable Breast Pump , an industry-first warm-massage breast pump combining 360\u00b0 warmth, 5-zone vibration massage and SoftPulseTM Technology to support comfort and the body's natural let-down response.* Its wearable design reflects Momcozy's focus on practical innovations that fit more naturally into mothers' everyday routines. Supporting Filipino Mothers Breathe & Breastfeed marks an important step in Momcozy's growing presence in the Philippines, bringing experts, communities and mothers together to make breastfeeding support more accessible and practical. Through continued education, community engagement and innovation, Momcozy aims to help mothers feel better informed, supported and confident in making choices that work for themselves and their families. *Based on available market data as of November 2025. About Momcozy Founded in 2018, Momcozy, the Global No.1 Wearable Breast Pump Brand*, supports mothers from pregnancy through postpartum and beyond with wearable breast pumps, feeding essentials, nursing wear and maternal-care solutions. Chosen by over 6 million moms and families across more than 80 countries and regions, Momcozy is committed to making motherhood more comfortable, convenient and supported through practical innovation. *Based on global market share of wearable breast pumps, Grand View Research 2024.", "content": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PAID PLANS", "keywords": ["hhp", "hou", "chi", "hea", "wom"], "creator": ["cision pr newswire"], "language": "english", "country": ["qatar", "bahrain", "romania", "bangladesh", "bhutan", "tajikistan", "yemen", "turkmenistan", "brunei", "afghanistan", "vietnam", "turkey", "pakistan", "singapore", "timor-leste", "macau", "united arab emirates", "syria", "armenia", "saudi arabia", "laos", "azerbaijan", "uzbekistan", "philippines", "hong kong", "india", "china", "taiwan"], "category": ["top", "health"], "datatype": "pressrelease", "pubDate": "2026-08-21 09:33:00", "